<section id="about"><div class="wrap about">
<div>
<h2>About the College</h2>
<p class="sub" style="margin-bottom:14px">MIT Arts, Commerce &amp; Science College (MITACSC) was established in 2007 under the aegis of the Maharashtra Academy of Engineering and Educational Research (MAEER), Pune. It is affiliated to Savitribai Phule Pune University and recognized by the Government of Maharashtra.</p>
<p style="color:var(--muted)">MAEER's MIT was founded in 1983 by Dr. Vishwanath D. Karad and today runs professional programs through 72 institutions across four universities in India. The college campus is at Dehu Phata, Alandi (D), Tal. Khed, Pune.</p>
</div>
<div class="img" id="img-campus">Replace with campus photo</div>
</div></section>

<section id="programs" class="alt"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Programs Offered</h2>
<p class="sub">Full-time UG and PG programs under Savitribai Phule Pune University.</p>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><span class="tag">UG · Arts</span><h3>B.A.</h3><p>Bachelor of Arts, a 3-year degree.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="tag">UG · Commerce</span><h3>B.Com.</h3><p>A professional program with a foundation in finance, accounts and taxation.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="tag">UG · Management</span><h3>BBA &amp; BBA (International Business)</h3><p>Business administration programs with an option in international business.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="tag">UG · Computer</span><h3>BBA (Computer Application)</h3><p>Management combined with computer applications.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="tag">UG · Science</span><h3>B.Sc. Computer Science</h3><p>A 3-year program covering the latest developments in computing, core skills and technical knowledge.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="tag">UG · Science</span><h3>B.Sc. Animation</h3><p>Bachelor of Science in Animation.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="tag">UG · Computer</span><h3>BCA (Science)</h3><p>Bachelor of Computer Application (Science).</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="tag">PG · Science</span><h3>M.Sc. Computer Science</h3><p>A 2-year program focused on advanced programming and problem-solving. Also offered: M.Sc. Computer Application.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="tag">PG · Commerce</span><h3>M.Com.</h3><p>Master of Commerce, a postgraduate program of Savitribai Phule Pune University.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="tag">PG · Arts</span><h3>M.A. Mass Communication &amp; Journalism</h3><p>Postgraduate program in mass communication and journalism.</p></div>
</div>
<p style="margin-top:22px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">M.Sc. eligibility: bachelor's degree in Science / Technology / Engineering with at least 50% marks (45% for reserved category, as per Maharashtra Government rules). Eligible candidates apply online through the college website.</p>
</div></section>

